Package: kakaotalk-debian-wrapper
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: @HOMEPAGE@
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.35),
 curl, procps,
 fonts-noto-cjk,
 libx11-6, libxext6, libxrandr2, libxi6, libxcursor1, libxcomposite1,
 libxinerama1, libxfixes3, libxrender1, libxxf86vm1,
 libfreetype6, libfontconfig1,
 libgl1, libegl1, libvulkan1,
 libasound2t64 | libasound2, libpulse0,
 libdbus-1-3, libgnutls30t64 | libgnutls30,
 libgstreamer1.0-0, libgstreamer-plugins-base1.0-0,
 gstreamer1.0-plugins-base, gstreamer1.0-plugins-good,
 libunwind8, libudev1, libusb-1.0-0, libv4l-0t64 | libv4l-0
Recommends: gstreamer1.0-libav, icoutils, libnotify-bin, x11-xserver-utils,
 libsdl2-2.0-0, mesa-vulkan-drivers
Description: Unofficial wrapper to run Windows KakaoTalk with a bundled Wine
 Runs the Windows version of KakaoTalk in a dedicated Wine prefix with a
 bundled, patched Wine build, Korean font and input method setup, and
 desktop integration (menu entry, icon, kakaotalk:// links, autostart).
 .
 KakaoTalk itself is not included; it is downloaded from Kakao's official
 server on first run. This project is not affiliated with Kakao Corp.
